  "description_nl": "2026-10-11: the popup's questions: two PANs found (whose return?), none found, a PAN that is not the return chosen, no name, an HUF's name and Karta, a date of birth (it opens a locked AIS and decides the senior limits), residence when NRI was picked - nothing before a document is in. 2026-10-11: the popup's questions: two PANs found (whose return?), none found, a PAN (or a GST certificate's constitution) that is not the return chosen, no name, an HUF's name and Karta, a date of birth (it opens a locked AIS and decides the senior limits), residence when NRI was picked, a business's partners or members (filled in from its deed), its GSTIN when GST was picked and no document gave one - nothing before a document is in. 2026-10-11: the popup's questions: two PANs found (whose return?), none found, a PAN (or a GST certificate's constitution) that is not the return chosen, no name, an HUF's name and Karta, a date of birth (it opens a locked AIS and decides the senior limits), residence when NRI was picked, a business's partners or members (filled in from its deed), its GSTIN when GST was picked and no document gave one, a company's CIN, incorporation, tax option, manufacturing and directors (filled in from its certificate of incorporation) - nothing before a document is in. 2026-10-13: bank_only: the mobile and the address are asked when the statement did not give them. 2026-10-13: email and father's name: the return needs them too."
